WEBVTT

1
00:00:04,560 --> 00:00:15,900
Zhenke, wake up and watch me go help her

2
00:00:23,210 --> 00:00:25,210
I knew you couldn't help it

3
00:00:26,560 --> 00:00:28,120
Haven't eaten for two days

4
00:00:28,240 --> 00:00:31,420
No one can stand Dr. Zhou

5
00:00:32,020 --> 00:00:33,140
To live

6
00:00:33,340 --> 00:00:40,590
It's not shameful to bow to me. You're right. I don't want to die. I want to live.

7
00:00:42,510 --> 00:00:43,630
That's best

8
00:00:44,450 --> 00:00:46,610
You are still of some use to me now
